        'Navigator 1.6.3'
        'by Embarcadero Technologies in IDE Plugins for RAD Studio'
        
          'Your code at your fingertips. Ever wanted to jump to the uses cl' +
          'ause, to a class'#8217's constructor, to a property definition? Naviga' +
          'tor lets you move between any section of code quickly, easily, a' +
          'nd without your fingers leaving the keyboard. There'#8217's also a min' +
          'imap '#8211' a miniature version of your code, showing the structure a' +
          'nd letting you scroll just like a scrollbar. This plugin used to' +
          ' be Parnassus Navigator.'
