        'Bookmarks 1.6.3'
        'by Embarcadero Technologies in IDE Plugins for RAD Studio'
        
          'Navigate your code! Bookmarks replaces the IDE'#8217's inbuilt functio' +
          'nality with new, improved navigation. Place a marker with Ctrl+B' +
          ' '#8211' a number will be automatically assigned. Jump between bookmar' +
          'ks by pressing Ctrl+Alt+Left or Right Arrow. Never overwrite an ' +
          'existing bookmark accidentally. Elegant visual cues when you cre' +
          'ate, delete, or access a bookmark as well as succinct informatio' +
          'n about where in a unit the bookmark is. This plugin used to be ' +
          'Parnassus Bookmarks.'
